module

public import StacksFrontier.AlgebraicGeometry.Spaces.Descent.QuasiCoherent.FpqcHomGlue
public import StacksFrontier.AlgebraicGeometry.Spaces.TestSchemeFpqcSite
public import StacksFrontier.AlgebraicGeometry.Spaces.TestSchemePullbacks

/-!
# The relative Hom functor is an fpqc sheaf

In Situation 08JT — a morphism `f : X ⟶ B` of algebraic spaces over a scheme `S` and two
quasi-coherent `𝒪_X`-modules `F`, `G` — the functor `Hom(F, G)` on the schemes over `B` sending
`T` to `Hom_{𝒪_{X_T}}(F_T, G_T)` satisfies the sheaf property for the fpqc topology
(Stacks 08JV).

The topology is `AlgebraicGeometry.Space.fpqcTopology`, generated by the families of test
schemes whose underlying families of morphisms of schemes are fpqc coverings.  For such a family
the base changes `X_{T_i} ⟶ X_T` form an fpqc covering of algebraic spaces (Stacks 03MR), and
homomorphisms of quasi-coherent modules glue along it, which is
`AlgebraicGeometry.Space.gluesModuleHomAlongFpqcCovering` (Stacks 04W8); the sheaf property for
the presieve of the family is then
`AlgebraicGeometry.Space.HomSituation.isSheafFor_homFunctor`.

## Main results

* `AlgebraicGeometry.Space.HomSituation.isSheaf_homFunctor_fpqc`: **Stacks 08JV.**

## References

* [Stacks Project, Tag 08JV](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/08JV)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 08JT](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/08JT)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 04W8](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/04W8)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 03MR](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/03MR)
-/

@[expose] public noncomputable section

open CategoryTheory CategoryTheory.Limits

universe u

namespace AlgebraicGeometry.Space.HomSituation

variable {B : BigFppfSite.{u}} {S : Scheme.{u}} {hS : B.Contains S} (s : HomSituation B S hS)

/-- **Stacks 08JV.**  In Situation 08JT the relative Hom functor `Hom(F, G)`, sending a scheme
`T` over the base to `Hom_{𝒪_{X_T}}(F_T, G_T)`, satisfies the sheaf property for the fpqc
topology on the schemes over the base.

Its functoriality is the pseudofunctoriality of Stacks 03LU, which is
`AlgebraicGeometry.Space.modulePushforwardCoherence`, proved with no hypothesis. -/
@[stacks 08JV]
theorem isSheaf_homFunctor_fpqc :
    Presheaf.IsSheaf (fpqcTopology s.base) (s.homFunctor (modulePushforwardCoherence B S hS)) := by
  rw [isSheaf_iff_isSheaf_of_type, fpqcTopology,
    Precoverage.isSheaf_toGrothendieck_iff_of_isStableUnderBaseChange]
  intro T R hR
  rw [← Presieve.presieve₀_preZeroHypercover R] at hR ⊢
  simp only [Precoverage.mem_comap_iff, Presieve.map_ofArrows] at hR
  exact s.isSheafFor_homFunctor (modulePushforwardCoherence B S hS) R.preZeroHypercover.f
    (represented_fpqc_family B S hS _ _ _ hR)

end AlgebraicGeometry.Space.HomSituation

end
